From 0f396da625ff417be5114a4a288acab302086d06 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Braun <sam@webry.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 13:18:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(app): close only after an ending; tested refusals,
 panics, close-wait

Merge::has_ended decides the window destroy; Listing wraps StopList;
merge.rs tests move to merge/tests.rs; fixture mode answers
MergeFinished/MergeAborted as the app does.

Refs #1352-#1364
